PREFAB Experience
ENTITY Experience 1
    COMPONENT TransformComponent
        VECTOR_3 position 0.0 0.0 0.0
        QUATERNION rotation 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0
        VECTOR_3 scale 0.38499999046326 0.38499999046326 0.38499999046326
    COMPONENT XPComponent
        INT experience 5
    COMPONENT RenderComponent
        STRING meshName sphere.mesh
        STRING materialName 
        BOOL isVisible true
    COMPONENT PickableComponent
        FLOAT pickupRadius 0.5
    START_CHILDREN
    END_CHILDREN
END_ENTITY

